      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    prices = [102, 100, 105, 107, 103]\n    volumes = [1500, 1600, 1400, 1300, 1350]\n    nvi = 1000.0\n\n    for day in range(1, len(prices)):\n        if volumes[day] < volumes[day - 1]:\n            price_change = (prices[day] - prices[day - 1]) / prices[day - 1]\n            nvi *= 1 + price_change\n\n    return round(nvi, 2)\n```",
